-- statement:
--   The cross-inner-product identity for chronologically disjoint constructed elementary
--   Brownian values.
--
--   Source: https://github.com/savarin/lean-malliavin/blob/a1a6ccc6eedbdf15fc3aebf9146d1fddfa0c8272/Malliavin/ElementaryIto.lean#L523-L534
